{"id":51528,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51528"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:10:30","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:10:30","slug":"meia-maratona-evora","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-evora\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de \u00c9vora 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de \u00c9vora 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de \u00c9vora 2026<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>21 e 22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico da cidade-museu de <strong>\u00c9vora<\/strong>, classificada como Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO no Alentejo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O fim de semana desportivo arranca no s\u00e1bado, \u00e0s 15:00, com a <strong>Run Kids<\/strong> (dos 300 m aos 1.000 m) na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Giraldo<\/strong>. No domingo de manh\u00e3, a partida junto ao monumental <strong>Aqueduto da \u00c1gua de Prata<\/strong> d\u00e1 o tiro de sa\u00edda para a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (09:15) e para as provas competitivas da <strong>Meia Maratona (21,1 km)<\/strong> e dos <strong>10 km<\/strong> (10:00), ambas com meta instalada na Pra\u00e7a do Giraldo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de \u00c9vora<\/strong> com dire\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong> e limitada a 6.000 participantes, a prova oferece t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (\u00e0 escolha entre manga cava ou manga curta), medalha <em>finisher<\/em> e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o Top 20 geral e para os melhores atletas eborenses. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255,