/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de \u00c9vora 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se nos dias 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026 em \u00c9vora. No s\u00e1bado (21\/11), a Run Kids parte e chega na Pra\u00e7a do Giraldo \u00e0s 15:00. No domingo (22\/11), a Caminhada de 5 km (09:15), a Meia Maratona de 21,1 km (10:00) e os 10 km (10:00) partem do Aqueduto da \u00c1gua de Prata e terminam na Pra\u00e7a do Giraldo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 4 fases (at\u00e9 31\/08, at\u00e9 30\/09, at\u00e9 31\/10 e de 1 a 21\/11\/2026): Meia Maratona 21,1 km (16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac), Corrida 10 km (12 \u20ac \/ 14 \u20ac \/ 16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac), Caminhada 5 km (8 \u20ac \/ 9 \u20ac \/ 10 \u20ac \/ 11 \u20ac) e Run Kids (pre\u00e7o \u00fanico de 5 \u20ac). O limite global \u00e9 de 6.000 vagas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 entregue o kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do kit de atleta decorre na Arena de \u00c9vora na sexta-feira (20\/11, das 10h00 \u00e0s 18h00), no s\u00e1bado (21\/11, das 10h00 \u00e0s 18h00) e no domingo (22\/11, das 08h00 \u00e0s 09h30). O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (op\u00e7\u00e3o manga cava ou manga curta nos 21,1 km e 10 km), dorsal personalizado (para inscritos at\u00e9 08\/11) e medalha na meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios atribu\u00eddos na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Meia Maratona 21,1 km h\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 20 primeiros da Geral Masculina e Feminina (1\u00ba: 400 \u20ac, 2\u00ba: 200 \u20ac, 3\u00ba: 100 \u20ac, at\u00e9 ao 20\u00ba: 25 \u20ac) e para os 3 primeiros Eborenses M\/F (100 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac e 50 \u20ac). Nos 10 km s\u00e3o premiados os 5 primeiros da Geral M\/F (75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac, 25 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e quem organiza o evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas de domingo t\u00eam a dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 3 horas (encerramento \u00e0s 13:00). O evento \u00e9 organizado pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de \u00c9vora em parceria t\u00e9cnica com a HMS Sports Consulting.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de \u00c9vora 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Aqueduto da \u00c1gua de Prata e Pra\u00e7a do Giraldo, \u00c9vora\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"\u00c9vora\", \"addressRegion\": \"\u00c9vora\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de \u00c9vora \/ HMS Sports\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de \u00c9vora 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se nos dias 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026 em \u00c9vora. No s\u00e1bado (21\/11), a Run Kids parte e chega na Pra\u00e7a do Giraldo \u00e0s 15:00. No domingo (22\/11), a Caminhada de 5 km (09:15), a Meia Maratona de 21,1 km (10:00) e os 10 km (10:00) partem do Aqueduto da \u00c1gua de Prata e terminam na Pra\u00e7a do Giraldo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 4 fases (at\u00e9 31\/08, at\u00e9 30\/09, at\u00e9 31\/10 e de 1 a 21\/11\/2026): Meia Maratona 21,1 km (16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac), Corrida 10 km (12 \u20ac \/ 14 \u20ac \/ 16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac), Caminhada 5 km (8 \u20ac \/ 9 \u20ac \/ 10 \u20ac \/ 11 \u20ac) e Run Kids (pre\u00e7o \u00fanico de 5 \u20ac). O limite global \u00e9 de 6.000 vagas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 entregue o kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do kit de atleta decorre na Arena de \u00c9vora na sexta-feira (20\/11, das 10h00 \u00e0s 18h00), no s\u00e1bado (21\/11, das 10h00 \u00e0s 18h00) e no domingo (22\/11, das 08h00 \u00e0s 09h30). O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (op\u00e7\u00e3o manga cava ou manga curta nos 21,1 km e 10 km), dorsal personalizado (para inscritos at\u00e9 08\/11) e medalha na meta.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios atribu\u00eddos na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na Meia Maratona 21,1 km h\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 20 primeiros da Geral Masculina e Feminina (1\u00ba: 400 \u20ac, 2\u00ba: 200 \u20ac, 3\u00ba: 100 \u20ac, at\u00e9 ao 20\u00ba: 25 \u20ac) e para os 3 primeiros Eborenses M\/F (100 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac e 50 \u20ac). Nos 10 km s\u00e3o premiados os 5 primeiros da Geral M\/F (75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac, 25 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e quem organiza o evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As provas de domingo t\u00eam a dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 3 horas (encerramento \u00e0s 13:00). O evento \u00e9 organizado pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de \u00c9vora em parceria t\u00e9cnica com a HMS Sports Consulting.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70187,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,624,41],"event_type_2":[728,132,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51528","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-evora","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-evora","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-evora.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51528","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51528"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51528\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70188,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51528\/revisions\/70188"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70187"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portug